<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h2 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-0-0">功能描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-1"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-1-0">用流水线控制 Store、Probe、Refill、以及原子操作对 cache 的修改。MainPipe 是 DCache 里唯一修改 Tag、Meta、Data 的流水线。普通 load 命中留在 LoadPipe。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-2"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-2-0">它处理六类会改 cache 的事务：</span></p><ul list="ub40921a4"><li fid="u2595bfd1" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-3"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-3-0">Sbuffer 提交的 store 数据。命中且有写权限时按字节合并后写入；没有写权限时在 s2 发送MissReq给 MissQueue，不进入 s3。</span></li><li fid="u2595bfd1" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-4" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-4"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-4-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-4-0">MissQueue 的 refill。把已经拼好的 64B 数据装进 tag 命中的那一路。replace在refill的途中做完。</span></li><li fid="u2595bfd1" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-5" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-5"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-5-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-5-0">ProbeQueue 转发来的 Snoop。查当前 cache，命中才改 Meta，需要数据时把整行交给 WritebackQueue。miss 不分配 MSHR，也不变成 refill。</span></li><li fid="u2595bfd1" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-6" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-6"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-6-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-6-0">AtomicsUnit 来的 LR、SC、AMO、AMOCAS。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8fed8f0f" id="u8fed8f0f"><br></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-9" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-9"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u6e36afcd" id="u6e36afcd"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-25" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-25"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-25-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-25-0">接口描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u6e474eea" id="u6e474eea"><span data-lake-id="ue28a44ef" id="ue28a44ef">这里的方向是从MainPipe的视角来看的in/out。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-27" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-27"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-27-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-27-0">入口</span></h3><table data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 748px"><colgroup><col width="187"><col width="187"><col width="187"><col width="187"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-0-0-0">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-1-0-0">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-2-0-0">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-3"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-3-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-0-3-0-0">说明</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-0-0-0">probe</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-1-0-0">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-2-0-0">Decoupled MainPipeReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-3"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-3-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-1-3-0-0">ProbeQueue 来的 Snoop，优先级最高</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-0-0-0">refill</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-1-0-0">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-28-0-3-2-0-0">Decoupled MainPipeReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-