span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-2-0-0">s2/s3</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-3"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-3-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-3-3-0-0">告诉对应 MSHR：数据还没准备好、s3 已提交、本地安装决定已做完</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-0-0-0">pendingSnoop</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-1-0-0">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-2-0-0">missId 查询</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-3"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-3-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-36-0-4-3-0-0">s3 写 Meta 前再看一眼该 MSHR 有没有未处理完的同地址 Snoop</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u26df37da" id="u26df37da"><td data-lake-id="u2b933f65" id="u2b933f65"><p data-lake-id="u6c863ec2" id="u6c863ec2"><span data-lake-id="ud7a745cb" id="ud7a745cb" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">occupySet</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6274f1c2" id="u6274f1c2"><p data-lake-id="u9555ff70" id="u9555ff70"><span data-lake-id="udb19cd53" id="udb19cd53" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4c9c8754" id="u4c9c8754"><p data-lake-id="u8a4cf498" id="u8a4cf498"><span data-lake-id="u772122bd" id="u772122bd" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">set</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua2bb3bb2" id="ua2bb3bb2"><p data-lake-id="u884990a6" id="u884990a6"><span data-lake-id="u28bb01c7" id="u28bb01c7" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">store 或原子做权限升级时，问这个 set</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u38000825" id="u38000825"><td data-lake-id="u14101d0d" id="u14101d0d"><p data-lake-id="u84e2ab81" id="u84e2ab81"><span data-lake-id="u26341acd" id="u26341acd" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">occupyWay</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue384eaaf" id="ue384eaaf"><p data-lake-id="u3f064c4e" id="u3f064c4e"><span data-lake-id="u228d1891" id="u228d1891" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5ac0beb5" id="u5ac0beb5"><p data-lake-id="u38879321" id="u38879321"><span data-lake-id="u8ee9f928" id="u8ee9f928" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">4 bit</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u07e99926" id="u07e99926"><p data-lake-id="u5a9b7b8b" id="u5a9b7b8b"><span data-lake-id="u1ae210fa" id="u1ae210fa" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">这个 set 上正在权限升级的 way。refill 选 victim 时不能选这些 way</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1f8ba90e" id="u1f8ba90e"><td data-lake-id="ud0888a33" id="ud0888a33"><p data-lake-id="ub10f9233" id="ub10f9233"><span data-lake-id="ue287aaa3" id="ue287aaa3" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">occupyFail</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u93a1db44" id="u93a1db44"><p data-lake-id="ud97ab6f2" id="ud97ab6f2"><span data-lake-id="u2ecdbdc1" id="u2ecdbdc1" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub7cd7eea" id="ub7cd7eea"><p data-lake-id="u2bcf1276" id="u2bcf1276"><span data-lake-id="u8a13118f" id="u8a13118f" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">Bool</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2632d130" id="u2632d130"><p data-lake-id="u3354996b" id="u3354996b"><span data-lake-id="u5520632c" id="u5520632c" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">这个 set 已经有 3 路在途权限升级。新的权限升级本拍不要发 missReq</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u162c924b" id="u162c924b"><td data-lake-id="u77cd161a" id="u77cd161a"><p data-lake-id="u25949b1c" id="u25949b1c"><span data-lake-id="u507a6958" id="u507a6958" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">wbBlock</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4a6ee506" id="u4a6ee506"><p data-lake-id="ud3803a4a" id="ud3803a4a"><span data-lake-id="uc9c7e493" id="uc9c7e493" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u80026799" id="u80026799"><p data-lake-id="ufb292603" id="ufb292603"><span data-lake-id="u5c857324" id="u5c857324" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">同地址查询</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4dac135f" id="u4dac135f"><p data-lake-id="ud082ce6c" id="ud082ce6c"><span data-lake-id="u3ef2d8eb" id="u3ef2d8eb" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">同地址写回还在 WritebackQueue 时，本拍不发 missReq</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-37" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-37"><code data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-37-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-37-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-37-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-37-0-0">missReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-37-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-37-1"> 带上地址、vaddr、alias、cmd、store 数据与 mask、原子数据、当前 Meta、是否整行覆盖。选 ReadShared、ReadUnique 还是 MakeUnique 由 MissQueue 决定。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-38" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-38"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="writebackqueue" id="writebackqueue" class="lake-lineheight-115"><span data-lake-id="u0ab6f0da" id="u0ab6f0da" style="color: #000000">WritebackQueue</span></h3><p data-lake-id="uf4c64d69" id="uf4c64d69"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="uJK2R" id="uJK2R"><span data-lake-id="u6d140a60" id="u6d140a60">ProbeQueue</span></h3><table data-lake-id="GTg0Q" id="GTg0Q" class="lake-table" style="width: 600px"><colgroup><col width="150"><col width="150"><col width="150"><col width="150"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u7f6b5496" id="u7f6b5496"><td data-lake-id="u370ab709" id="u370ab709"><p data-lake-id="ua7df0a53" id="ua7df0a53" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u0b9a4018" id="u0b9a4018" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3295ad88" id="u3295ad88"><p data-lake-id="ub509c842" id="ub509c842" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uebe5880b" id="uebe5880b" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf6b18b40" id="uf6b18b40"><p data-lake-id="ubcd42713" id="ubcd42713" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u4a06b137" id="u4a06b137" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">类型</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1a7b1f27" id="u1a7b1f27"><p data-lake-id="ub9fbf48b" id="ub9fbf48b" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u5d9b2a50" id="u5d9b2a50" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">作用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ude3f977c" id="ude3f977c"><td data-lake-id="ufdb50ca3" id="ufdb50ca3"><p data-lake-id="ub0e9d128" id="ub0e9d128" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uc53ed791" id="uc53ed791" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">lrsc_blocked_block</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u368134ad" id="u368134ad"><p data-lake-id="u73b27896" id="u73b27896" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u3356398c" id="u3356398c" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u99587fa8" id="u99587fa8"><p data-lake-id="u08ae7931" id="u08ae7931" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud9727bec" id="ud9727bec">Valid(UInt(PAddrBits.W))</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uba6c38c8" id="uba6c38c8"><p data-lake-id="u26a95c24" id="u26a95c24" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u648e65b6" id="u648e65b6" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">valid的时候是计数大于8，bits就是lrsc_addr，也就是cacheline的地址</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u1eaa9f7f" id="u1eaa9f7f"><td data-lake-id="u588cd374" id="u588cd374"><p data-lake-id="u521e5797" id="u521e5797" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u10d48e66" id="u10d48e66" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">update_resv_set</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ucebc3d79" id="ucebc3d79"><p data-lake-id="uab762b13" id="uab762b13" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ud8262535" id="ud8262535" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc702e995" id="uc702e995"><p data-lake-id="ua66b51ac" id="ua66b51ac" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ue943240c" id="ue943240c" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">Bool()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u304bb8ac" id="u304bb8ac"><p data-lake-id="u35d61e8c" id="u35d61e8c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u05d87223" id="u05d87223" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">LR在Mainpipe建立reservation的时候为1，让下一拍ProbeQueue阻塞所有的Probe</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4b76f54e" id="u4b76f54e"><td data-lake-id="u2ca7a196" id="u2ca7a196"><p data-lake-id="u0900bba1" id="u0900bba1" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u0d9b04f3" id="u0d9b04f3" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">invalid_rescv_set</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc3aef78d" id="uc3aef78d"><p data-lake-id="uf611789f" id="uf611789f" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u866029e8" id="u866029e8" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufbd88d50" id="ufbd88d50"><p data-lake-id="u86e80d02" id="u86e80d02" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u8cd18454" id="u8cd18454" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">Bool()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u70eba0f5" id="u70eba0f5"><p data-lake-id="u6152e8df" id="u6152e8df" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="uf93cdb6b" id="uf93cdb6b" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">reservation有效时，进来SC，下一排把lrsc_count请0</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u06fd0887" id="u06fd0887"><td data-lake-id="u34653342" id="u34653342"><p data-lake-id="u0167e700" id="u0167e700" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u47fa8cc6" id="u47fa8cc6" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">block_lr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3c1ae5fe" id="u3c1ae5fe"><p data-lake-id="ucb58407c" id="ucb58407c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u6da7d5e0" id="u6da7d5e0" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u62887364" id="u62887364"><p data-lake-id="u3289690c" id="u3289690c" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u8991d929" id="u8991d929" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">Bool()</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u00e85544" id="u00e85544"><p data-lake-id="udeba556a" id="udeba556a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u229a867a" id="u229a867a" class="lake-fontsize-11" style="color: #000000">告诉AtomicsUnit阻塞lr。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="ue10ef7fe" id="ue10ef7fe"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-45" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-45"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-45-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-45-0">事务描述</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-46" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-46"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-46-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-46-0">Store</span></h3><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-47" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-47"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-47-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-47-0">store请求是从StoreBuffer中来的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-48" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-48"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-48-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-48-0">s1 同时看 tag 和 Meta：</span></p><table data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 579px"><colgroup><col width="196"><col width="194"><col width="189"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-0-0-0">当前状态</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-1-0-0">s2 去向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-0-2-0-0">写入后的状态</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-0-0-0">tag 不命中，或 Meta 是 I</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-1-0-0">MissQueue</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-1-2-0-0">不在本条流水写 array</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-0-0-0">SC</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-1-0-0">MissQueue，做权限升级</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-2-2-0-0">不在本条流水写 array</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-0-0-0">UC</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-1-0-0">s3</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-3-2-0-0">UD</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-0-0-0">UD</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-1-0-0">s3</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-49-0-4-2-0-0">UD</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50-0">部分写入的 bank 要先读旧数据，s3 按 byte mask 合并。某个 bank 的 mask 全 1 时，这个 bank 不读旧数据。64B mask 全 1 时，整行不读，</span><code data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50-1"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50-1-0">fullOverwrite=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-50-2">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-51" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-51"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-51-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-51-0">store miss 不进 s3。MissQueue 暂时不能收，或者 WritebackQueue 里还有同地址写回，就向 Sbuffer 回 replay，不把这行写成命中。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-52" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-52"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-52-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-52-0">权限升级之后，MissQueue 把 store 数据和 mask 留在原 MSHR 里，refill 重访时再合并。MainPipe 不另开一个 MSHR。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2b0d6e94" id="u2b0d6e94"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-63" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-63"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-63-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-63-0">Refill</span></h3><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-64" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-64"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-64-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-64-0">MissQueue 收齐两拍 256 bit 后才发 refill。MainPipe 看到的是整行，不处理 DataID。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-65" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-65"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-65-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-65-0">s1 选 way，顺序固定：</span></p><ol list="u8bec6179"><li fid="ubf786e37" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-66" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-66"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-66-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-66-0">物理 tag 已经命中：用命中的 way。这是权限升级或同一行重装，不需要 replace。</span></li><li fid="ubf786e37" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-67" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-67"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-67-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-67-0">否则使用 MissQueue 指定的 way。这个 way 必须已经是 I。</span></li><li fid="ubf786e37" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-68" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-68"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-68-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-68-0">MissQueue 还没指定时，有 I way 就选编号最小的，否则把 PLRU way 作为建议，但不在本条 refill 里覆盖它。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-70" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-70"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-70-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-70-0">安装时，这一路的状态来自 refill 的返回状态和 PassDirty：</span></p><table data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 517px"><colgroup><col width="118"><col width="149"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-0-0-0">返回权限</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-1-0-0">PassDirty</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-0-2-0-0">安装结果</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-0-0-0">共享</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-1-0-0">否</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-1-2-0-0">SC</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-0-0-0">独占</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-1-0-0">否</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-2-2-0-0">UC</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-0-0-0">独占</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-1-0-0">是</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-71-0-3-2-0-0">UD</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-72" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-72"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-72-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-72-0">共享并且 PassDirty 的数据不在 L1 收成 SD。安装前先把脏数据交给 WritebackQueue，本地只留 SC。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73-0">s3 写 tag、data、meta。写完向 MissQueue 回 </span><code data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73-1"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73-1-0">s3RefillResp</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-73-2">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue9eb1309" id="ue9eb1309"><span data-lake-id="u1c05f08b" id="u1c05f08b">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-74" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-74"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-74-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-74-0">Probe</span></h3><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-76" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-76"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-76-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-76-0">s1 用物理 tag 判断 hit。miss 的定义是没有有效 way 的 tag 相等。miss 时：</span></p><ul list="u61463e56"><li fid="u4c9da20b" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-77" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-77"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-77-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-77-0">不分配 MSHR。</span></li><li fid="u4c9da20b" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-78" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-78"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-78-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-78-0">不读完整数据，也不写 array。</span></li><li fid="u4c9da20b" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-79" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-79"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-79-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-79-0">s3 回应 ProbeQueue：状态 I，无数据。</span></li><li fid="u4c9da20b" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-80" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-80"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-80-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-80-0">ProbeQueue 发 TXRSP，不发 TXDAT。</span></li></ul><table data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 573px"><colgroup><col width="99"><col width="192"><col width="282"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-0-0-0">动作</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-1-0-0">新 Meta</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-0-2-0-0">数据</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-0-0-0">失效</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-1-0-0">I</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-1-2-0-0">UD，或对方要求数据，则整行交给 WritebackQueue</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-0-0-0">降为共享</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-1-0-0">SC。原来已是 SC 则不变</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-2-2-0-0"> UD 时带数据，并 PassDirty</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-0-0-0">清理脏责任</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-1-0-0">UD 变为 UC，其余不变</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-82-0-3-2-0-0"> UD 时带数据，并 PassDirty</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-83" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-83"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-83-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-83-0">hit 和 miss 都必须回应。Meta 没有变化时不写 Meta。数据一旦交给 WritebackQueue，ProbeQueue 要等数据发送完成后才能释放自己的条目；MainPipe 在 wbReq 握手后就可以离开 s3。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-84" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-84"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-84-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-84-0">同地址 Snoop 在 reservation 有效时不进入 MainPipe。窗口结束后再进入，这时按普通 Snoop 处理；如果 reservation 还在，处理这行时清除它。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1b04451c" id="u1b04451c"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-99" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-99"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-99-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-99-0">原子操作</span></h3><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100-0">LR、SC、AMO、AMOCAS 从 AtomicsUnit 进入。miss 时 s2 发 </span><code data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100-1"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100-1-0">missReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-100-2">，数据回来后仍由 MainPipe 做运算和写入，再给 AtomicsUnit 响应。</span></p><table data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 595px"><colgroup><col width="99"><col width="200"><col width="296"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-0-0-0">指令</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-1-0-0">命中条件</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-0-2-0-0">结果</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-0-0-0">LR</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-1-0-0">UC 或 UD</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-1-2-0-0">返回数据，建立 reservation。不写 data</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-0-0-0">LR</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-1-0-0">SC、I 或不命中</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-2-2-0-0">交给 MissQueue 取独占权限，回来后重做</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-0-0-0">SC</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-1-0-0">reservation 地址相同，且仍是 UC 或 UD</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-3-2-0-0">写入，清 reservation，返回成功</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-0-0-0">SC</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-1-0-0">reservation 失效，或已经没有写权限</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-4-2-0-0">不写，返回失败</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-0-0-0">AMO、AMOCAS</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-1-0-0">UC 或 UD</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-5-2-0-0">s3 读旧数据，运算后写回，状态保持 UD</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-0-0-0">AMOCAS 比较失败</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-1-0-0">UC 或 UD</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-6-2-0-0">返回旧数据，不写</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7"><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-0"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-0-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-0-0-0">AMO、AMOCAS</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-1"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-1-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-1-0-0">没有写权限</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-2"><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-2-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-2-0-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-101-0-7-2-0-0">同 LR，先取独占权限再重做</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u470338c4" id="u470338c4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u57e1b4a6" id="u57e1b4a6">LR/SC行为：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u859a2604" id="u859a2604">LR从rs1指向的地址加载到rd，同时建立一个reservation。SC会把rs2寄存器中的值写入rs1指向的地址，如果reservation有效则写入成功，并且rd写入0；若reservation无效，rd写入1。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-103" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-103"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-103-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-103-0">LR/SC做法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub946baa6" id="ub946baa6">：YQH中只有一套reservation，放在MainPipe中，由 lrsc_addr 和 lrsc_count 组成。地址按64B cacheline对齐，不保存LR读出来的数。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub25169b5" id="ub25169b5"><span data-lake-id="ub9cbb89f" id="ub9cbb89f">首先LR建立reservation，AtomicsUnit做完地址翻译，并等store buffer排空，然后向MainPipe发LR的atomic_req。请求进入Mainpipe之后，若hit则进入s3，若miss则申请MSHR等待refill写回DCache之后再进MainPipe。s3从data array取出LR要求的字，送回到AtomicsUnit，后写入rd。s3同一拍把 lrsc_addr 写成这块cacheline的地址(记录LR地址)， 令lrsc_count 为63。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf29b5fd3" id="uf29b5fd3"><span data-lake-id="ufd164d90" id="ufd164d90">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u38625b21" id="u38625b21"><span data-lake-id="ub0d963ad" id="ub0d963ad">reservation存在期间，这个 lrsc_count 每拍减1。有且仅有 lrsc_count 大于8时的reservation才有效，和 lrsc_addr 相同地址的SC才能成功，ProbeQueue会阻塞掉对这个地址的probe。计数 lrsc_count 小于8的时候，reservation失效，SC同地址也会失败，probeQueue不会阻塞prob了，但block_lr仍为1，AtomicsUnit暂时不能再发吓一跳LR。计数到0了之后，AtomicsUnit才能再发LR，才能建立起新reservation。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9aa7fc70" id="u9aa7fc70"><span data-lake-id="u8358881c" id="u8358881c">SC消除reservation。SC即使miss也能进入MainPipe的s3，不申请MSHR。进来s3之后检查三件事情：①地址和 lrsc_addr相同，②lrsc_count &gt; 8，③cache命中。只有这三件事情都成立才会把rs2的值写入data array中，同时rd写为1；否则rd得到1，也不写rs2的值。但无论成功还是失败，lrsc_count都会清为0。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u863b5c77" id="u863b5c77"><span data-lake-id="u5cf44be4" id="u5cf44be4">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="udc3df688" id="udc3df688"><strong><span data-lake-id="u09889db3" id="u09889db3">AMOCAS行为:</span></strong></p><table data-lake-id="Q1RWG" id="Q1RWG" class="lake-table" style="width: 595px"><colgroup><col width="99"><col width="200"><col width="296"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ue07df667" id="ue07df667"><td data-lake-id="u91cff786" id="u91cff786"><p data-lake-id="u612328c4" id="u612328c4"><span data-lake-id="ub4fe43c3" id="ub4fe43c3">指令</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uee67457e" id="uee67457e"><p data-lake-id="uc2b4cdd3" id="uc2b4cdd3"><span data-lake-id="u42892e01" id="u42892e01">比较和写入</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uab4e28ff" id="uab4e28ff"><p data-lake-id="u76683f02" id="u76683f02"><code data-lake-id="u4caf3c13" id="u4caf3c13"><span data-lake-id="uc5499237" id="uc5499237">rd</span></code></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u20f429b5" id="u20f429b5"><td data-lake-id="u9d45ca89" id="u9d45ca89"><p data-lake-id="u89be1e94" id="u89be1e94"><span data-lake-id="ud8a1c8ea" id="ud8a1c8ea">amocas.w</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2ae0be3e" id="u2ae0be3e"><p data-lake-id="u4d863d8d" id="u4d863d8d"><span data-lake-id="u447e9f53" id="u447e9f53">4 字节，地址 4 字节对齐</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue9380b9e" id="ue9380b9e"><p data-lake-id="ubdfbd6e4" id="ubdfbd6e4"><span data-lake-id="u84db3350" id="u84db3350">旧的 32 位，符号扩展</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ue6794688" id="ue6794688"><td data-lake-id="ue9beb182" id="ue9beb182"><p data-lake-id="udecea4f6" id="udecea4f6"><span data-lake-id="u3736263c" id="u3736263c">amocas.d</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5a13b38b" id="u5a13b38b"><p data-lake-id="u625df323" id="u625df323"><span data-lake-id="ub714f8b0" id="ub714f8b0">8 字节，地址 8 字节对齐</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u53c9758b" id="u53c9758b"><p data-lake-id="uc87bd23f" id="uc87bd23f"><span data-lake-id="uf669a6ed" id="uf669a6ed">旧的 64 位</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u04199ad3" id="u04199ad3"><td data-lake-id="u7e0d0f0a" id="u7e0d0f0a"><p data-lake-id="u2aa89d11" id="u2aa89d11"><span data-lake-id="u577d40b8" id="u577d40b8">amocas.q</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u04ab2624" id="u04ab2624"><p data-lake-id="ua95d08e5" id="ua95d08e5"><span data-lake-id="ue6e7016e" id="ue6e7016e">16 字节，地址 16 字节对齐</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u0f3fd33a" id="u0f3fd33a"><p data-lake-id="u813fc40c" id="u813fc40c"><span data-lake-id="uf6f3235d" id="uf6f3235d">低 64 位进 </span><code data-lake-id="u3ed2b545" id="u3ed2b545"><span data-lake-id="ubae12b0a" id="ubae12b0a">rd</span></code><span data-lake-id="uc3f50243" id="uc3f50243">，高 64 位进 </span><code data-lake-id="u23899b88" id="u23899b88"><span data-lake-id="u3521cc8a" id="u3521cc8a">rd+1</span></code><span data-lake-id="u5965fdf2" id="u5965fdf2">。</span><code data-lake-id="u694bf5c8" id="u694bf5c8"><span data-lake-id="u7b5e3be2" id="u7b5e3be2">rs2</span></code><span data-lake-id="uc1577d8e" id="uc1577d8e"> 同样是一对寄存器</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u706db869" id="u706db869"><span data-lake-id="u9afdb4c9" id="u9afdb4c9">他们都是用rd中的旧值和rs1指向的内存比，相等就把rs2写进去rs1指向的内存。无论相等于否，rd都等于操作前的内存值。若比较不相等rs1指向的内存就一个字节也不改。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub4dede39" id="ub4dede39"><span data-lake-id="ude4496f1" id="ude4496f1">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="uc539a1b6" id="uc539a1b6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u02cbfb87" id="u02cbfb87">AMOCAS做法:</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua8dd6700" id="ua8dd6700">a</span></p><p data-lake-id="uec6aa016" id="uec6aa016"><span data-lake-id="u723a9bed" id="u723a9bed">在发AMOCAS请求之前需要先把storebuffer排空，然后再向MainPipe发atomic_req。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u010a2124" id="u010a2124"><span data-lake-id="uf30fc1e5" id="uf30fc1e5">若此时发现SC I 或者 Miss就发missreq去取独占，MSHR中要保留期望旧值，准备写入的新值，和mask。数据回来后就发refill_req，没有Atomics的replay机制。refill的s3先把有效旧行给WriteBackQueue，再在新行上做比较。AtomicsUnit停在响应，直到这次s3把旧数据送回来。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud094d039" id="ud094d039"><span data-lake-id="u1907082f" id="u1907082f">若此时发现</span><span data-lake-id="u5012298c" id="u5012298c">已经是 UC 或 UD 时，s1 读出命中 way 的整行。s3 从 word_idx 起取 16 字节，和 amo_cmp 异或，再只看 amo_mask 盖住的字节。这些字节里有一位不同就是失败。</span></p><ul list="uf967fad4"><li fid="u90d0b4cb" data-lake-id="u97138b7d" id="u97138b7d"><span data-lake-id="u50e85403" id="u50e85403">失败：不写 Data。返回这 16 字节里的旧数据。.w 再由 AtomicsUnit 按地址取出高半或低半，做符号扩展。</span></li><li fid="u90d0b4cb" data-lake-id="ua2b60032" id="ua2b60032"><span data-lake-id="u9d20a572" id="u9d20a572">成功：按同一张 mask 把 amo_data 写进对应 bank。.q 写 word_idx 和后面那一个 bank，word_idx 一定是偶数。Meta 变成 UD。返回的仍是写入前的旧数据。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3f29c973" id="u3f29c973"><span data-lake-id="ubc55ac70" id="ubc55ac70">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u9dd2c063" id="u9dd2c063"><span data-lake-id="u904752db" id="u904752db">其余的原子操作可见AMOALU。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u95be8f18" id="u95be8f18"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-120" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-120"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-120-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-120-0">流水级行为</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u04e05a27" id="u04e05a27"><span data-lake-id="udc8af1d7" id="udc8af1d7">四级流水。同一个 set 已在 s1、s2 或 s3 时，s0 不能再进入。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-121" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-121"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-121-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-121-0">四拍都用 valid、ready、fire。前一级 fire 才把结果写入后一级。后一级 ready 为 0 时，前一级停住。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-122" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-122"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-122-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-122-0">s0：选择请求并读 Tag、Meta</span></h3><ul list="u521a6767"><li fid="u8f11dda6" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-123" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-123"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-123-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-123-0">按 probe、replace、refill、cmo、store、atomic 的顺序选一条。</span></li><li fid="u8f11dda6" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124-0">用 </span><code data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124-1"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124-1-0">vaddr[13:6]</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-124-2"> 和 s1、s2、s3 比 set。相同则本拍不 fire。</span></li><li fid="u8f11dda6" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125-0">除 replace 外，向 Tag、Meta 发出该 set 的全 way 读。replace 只读 </span><code data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125-1"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125-1-0">replaceWayEn</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-125-2"> 指定的那一路，再用读出的 tag 核对请求里的物理地址。</span></li><li fid="u8f11dda6" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-126" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-126"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-126-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-126-0">算出哪些 bank 需要旧数据。probe、原子、replace 的脏行、CMO clean 读整行。部分 store 只读“被写到、但没有整 bank 覆盖”的 bank。</span></li><li fid="u8f11dda6" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127-0">store 是否真能参加仲裁，还要看 Data 口是不是正在被 load 使用。默认不等待；</span><code data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127-1" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127-1"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127-1-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127-1-0">force_write</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127-2" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-127-2"> 和等待阈值只作为性能旋钮，阈值 0 等于关闭。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-128" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-128"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-128-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-128-0">s1：比较、选 way、发数据读</span></h3><ul list="u32a018c2"><li fid="u1fa673cf" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-129" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-129"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-129-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-129-0">用物理地址比 4 个 tag，并丢掉 Meta 为 I 的 way。</span></li><li fid="u1fa673cf" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-130" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-130"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-130-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-130-0">判断写权限：UC、UD 可写，SC、I 不可写。</span></li><li fid="u1fa673cf" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-131" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-131"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-131-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-131-0">refill 先用命中 way。没有命中时，指定 way 必须已是 I；还没指定就选最小的 I way，否则只把 PLRU way 建议给 MissQueue，不在本条流水覆盖它。</span></li><li fid="u1fa673cf" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-132" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-132"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-132-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-132-0">需要旧数据时，向选中的 way 发 dataRead。</span></li><li fid="u1fa673cf" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-133" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-133"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-133-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-133-0">这一级不写 array，也不向 MissQueue 发请求。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-134" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-134"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-134-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-134-0">s2：分流</span></h3><ul list="ucdbfe5ce"><li fid="ud2489518" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-135" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-135"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-135-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-135-0">store 或原子没有权限：发 missReq。能发出就结束，不进 s3。不能发出就停在 s2，必要时回 replay。</span></li><li fid="ud2489518" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-136" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-136"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-136-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-136-0">同地址 WritebackQueue 还没完成：missReq 不能发。</span></li><li fid="ud2489518" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-137" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-137"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-137-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-137-0">store、原子、probe、CMO、replace、refill 需要继续改 array：等 s3 ready 后进入 s3。replace 的 way 地址核对失败则停在 s2 返回失败，不进 s3。</span></li><li fid="ud2489518" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-138" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-138"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-138-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-138-0">refill 进入 s3 前，refillInfo 必须有效。没有整行数据不能进 s3。</span></li><li fid="ud2489518" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-139" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-139"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-139-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-139-0">准备 byte 合并 mask。原子命中时不和 store 数据合并，s3 直接用读出的旧数据做运算。</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-140" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-140"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-140-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-140-0">s3：提交</span></h3><ul list="u2b4a95c3"><li fid="ue83a1a69" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-141" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-141"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-141-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-141-0">拿到 dataResp 后完成合并、原子运算或整行安装。</span></li><li fid="ue83a1a69" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-142" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-142"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-142-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-142-0">replace、probe、CMO 需要写回时，先握手 wbReq，再改 Meta。wbReq 没被收下，s3 停住。refill 不覆盖另一条仍有效的行。</span></li><li fid="ue83a1a69" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-143" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-143"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-143-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-143-0">写 Data、Meta、Tag。三项里哪些 ready 为 0，s3 就停住，请求保持不变。</span></li><li fid="ue83a1a69" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-144" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-144"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-144-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-144-0">refill 写 Meta 前查 pending snoop。</span></li><li fid="ue83a1a69" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-145" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-145"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-145-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-145-0">给 Sbuffer、AtomicsUnit、ProbeQueue、MissQueue 中对应的一方回响应。</span></li><li fid="ue83a1a69" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-146" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-146"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-146-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-146-0">命中写入或成功安装后更新 PLRU。</span></li><li fid="ue83a1a69" data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-147" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-147"><span data-lake-id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-147-0" id="md-8dea6964bed8bd2bf7804eb88e3709a1-0-147-0">fire 后清除本级 valid。AMOALU 那一拍也算占用 s3，同 set 的 s0 继续被挡住。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubfae5be5" id="ubfae5be5"><br></p>